# Supplemental batch p-blue-vt
# One texture coordinate appended at the end of the vt pool.  The face text
# is intentionally unchanged: its negative indices are relative to the pool
# end, so -1 now resolves to this new last entry.  The neighbouring face uses
# explicit positive indices and must keep pointing at the old records.
vt 5.0 5.0
f -3/-3/-1 -2/-2/-1 -1/-1/-1
